{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/translator-arab/layout,_N_T_/tools/translator-arab/page,_N_T_/tools/translator-arab"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"id\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/c70a6d8e0709b465.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/7eb325243a3b1d61.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-2718004965b0207a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2117-c5687b942395652d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f30bb01764683cd9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-8ce94bd856f9372b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4194-e847e413fe1b63d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/translator-arab/page-4783da3b6e7843d7.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-c819fc26cf8b0e32.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-8K10RNGN76\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\"/><title>Translator Arab ↔ Indonesia Kontekstual Madrasah (Dengan Penjelasan Nahwu) | TugasMu</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Penerjemah Bahasa Arab ke Indonesia khusus anak Madrasah. Dapatkan terjemahan akurat (Fusha) lengkap dengan penjelasan gramatikal Nahwu &amp; Shorof singkat.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tugasmu.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TugasMu\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy bg-brand-lime\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Translator arab</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container py-8 md:py-12 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Translator Arab ↔ Indonesia (Kontekstual)</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-lg\">Google Translate sering ngawur untuk tugas sekolah? Gunakan AI TugasMu yang dirancang khusus untuk memahami teks pelajaran Agama Islam, lengkap dengan penjelasan kaidah <strong>Nahwu &amp; Shorof</strong>-nya.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-md mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-bold shadow-sm\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option><option value=\"7\">Kelas <!-- -->7</option><option value=\"8\">Kelas <!-- -->8</option><option value=\"9\">Kelas <!-- -->9</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option><option value=\"Bahasa Indonesia\">Bahasa Indonesia</option><option value=\"Matematika\">Matematika</option><option value=\"IPA\">IPA</option><option value=\"IPS\">IPS</option><option value=\"Bahasa Inggris\">Bahasa Inggris</option><option value=\"PKn/PPKn\">PKn/PPKn</option><option value=\"Akidah Akhlak\">Akidah Akhlak</option><option value=\"Qur&#x27;an Hadis\">Qur&#x27;an Hadis</option><option value=\"Fikih\">Fikih</option><option value=\"Sejarah Kebudayaan Islam (SKI)\">Sejarah Kebudayaan Islam (SKI)</option><option value=\"Bahasa Arab\">Bahasa Arab</option><option value=\"PJOK\">PJOK</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-2 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl border border-outline-variant w-fit mx-auto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors bg-primary text-on-primary\">Arab</button><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant text-[18px]\">sync_alt</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container\">Indonesia</button></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Teks Masukan</label><textarea dir=\"rtl\" rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Masukkan teks Arab di sini...\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all resize-none disabled:opacity-50\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-sm disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">translate</span><span>Terjemahkan Sekarang</span></button></form><div class=\"mt-16 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-heading prose-a:text-emerald-600\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-6 h-6 text-emerald-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg>Mengapa Terjemahan Mesin Biasa Gagal dalam Bahasa Arab?</h2><p>Bagi siswa <strong>Madrasah Tsanawiyah (MTs)</strong> maupun <strong>Madrasah Aliyah (MA)</strong>, Bahasa Arab adalah salah satu mata pelajaran inti. Namun, saat diberi tugas menerjemahkan teks bacaan (<em>Qira&#x27;ah</em>) atau percakapan (<em>Hiwar</em>), banyak siswa yang mengandalkan Google Translate dan berujung pada terjemahan yang berantakan atau bahkan salah makna.</p><h3>Perbedaan Fusha dan Ammiyah</h3><p>Alasan utamanya adalah perbedaan antara Bahasa Arab Resmi (<strong>Fusha</strong>) yang dipelajari di sekolah, dengan Bahasa Arab Pasaran (<strong>Ammiyah</strong>) yang sering menjadi basis data mesin penerjemah umum. Di sekolah atau pesantren, kamu dituntut untuk menerjemahkan sesuai dengan kaidah keagamaan dan literatur akademik.</p><h3>Pentingnya Memahami Konteks Kalimat</h3><p>Bahasa Arab sangat bergantung pada konteks kalimat dan letak kata (kedudukan kata dalam kalimat). Perubahan satu harakat (misalnya <em>Fathah</em> menjadi <em>Kasrah</em>) bisa mengubah makna subjek menjadi objek. Tool Translator TugasMu mengatasi hal ini dengan:</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Mengenali Konteks:</strong> AI kami paham apakah kata <em>Dzaraba</em> (ضرب) bermaksud &quot;memukul&quot; secara fisik, atau &quot;membuat perumpamaan&quot; (dalam konteks Al-Quran).</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Penjelasan Kedudukan Kata:</strong> Tidak sekadar memberi arti, tool ini menjelaskan apakah sebuah kata berkedudukan sebagai <em>Mubtada</em>, <em>Khabar</em>, <em>Fa&#x27;il</em>, atau <em>Maf&#x27;ul Bih</em>.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Identifikasi Dhomir:</strong> Sangat membantu untuk tugas menerjemahkan cerita yang memiliki banyak kata ganti (Dia laki-laki, Mereka perempuan, dsb).</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Pertanyaan Seputar Pengecekan Grammar</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Panduan singkat tentang cara kerja korektor grammar ini.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah saya perlu mengetik harakat pada teks Arab?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p><strong>Tidak wajib.</strong> AI kami cukup pintar untuk membaca teks Arab &quot;gundul&quot; (tanpa harakat) dan menerjemahkannya berdasarkan konteks kalimat secara keseluruhan, persis seperti metode membaca Kitab Kuning.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah hasil terjemahan (Indo ke Arab) sudah ada harakatnya?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Ya. Saat kamu memilih mode terjemahan dari Bahasa Indonesia ke Bahasa Arab, hasil <em>output</em>-nya akan dilengkapi dengan harakat penuh (<em>Tasykil</em>) sehingga kamu tidak akan kesulitan saat harus membacanya di depan kelas.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Bisa digunakan untuk menerjemahkan ayat Al-Quran atau Hadits?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Bisa. Namun disarankan menggunakannya untuk potongan ayat pendek atau kalimat latihan di buku cetak. Untuk tafsir mendalam tentang suatu ayat, akan lebih baik merujuk langsung ke kitab tafsir yang mu&#x27;tabar (terpercaya).</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Kenapa saya harus memilih jenjang MTs atau MA?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Level penjelasan gramatikal akan disesuaikan. Anak MTs akan mendapatkan penjelasan Nahwu dasar, sedangkan anak MA mungkin akan mendapat penjelasan struktur yang sedikit lebih kompleks atau idiomatik.</p></div></div></details></div></section></div><div class=\"mt-12 mb-8\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Coba Tools Bermanfaat Lainnya</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group\" href=\"/tools/rangkuman\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors\">Rangkuman Materi</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Ringkas materi Sejarah Kebudayaan Islam (SKI) atau bab Fikih yang panjang menjadi poin-poin singkat.</p></a><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group\" href=\"/tools/generator-soal\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors\">Generator Soal Latihan</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Buat soal latihan bahasa Arab atau mapel lain lengkap dengan kunci jawabannya.</p></a></div></div></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.com</span></div><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 TugasMu.com. Hak cipta dilindungi.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs sm:text